  m_text: "Kanien'k\xE9ha translations & references from Six Nations Polytechnic,
    Deyohah\xE1:ge: Indigenous Knowledge Centre and FirstVoices.com\n\nSelect audio
    recordings from FirstVoices.com\n\nBackground music tracks from freesound.org\n\nUI
    sounds from pixabay.com\n\nBackground images, achievement icons, and Clan Mother
